  {
   "id": "crush-stdlib-md-13",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "## Paths — `path.*`\n\n`path.join(a, b)`, `dirname`, `basename`, `extension`, `stem`, `is_absolute`,\n`normalize` — pure string manipulation, no filesystem access.\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
  },
