  {
   "id": "crush-stdlib-md-15",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "## Regular expressions — `regex.*`\n\n**The pattern comes first**, then the text: `regex.test(pattern, text)`,\n`regex.find_all(pattern, text)`, `regex.replace(pattern, text, replacement)`,\n`regex.split(pattern, text)`.\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "id": "crush-stdlib-8",
   "kind": {
    "type": "crush"
   },
   "source": "print(regex.find_all(\"[0-9]+\", \"a1b22\"))\nprint(regex.replace(\"[0-9]\", \"a1b2\", \"#\"))\nprint(regex.split(\"[,;] *\", \"a, b;c\"))\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "pending"
   },
   "meta": {
    "tags": [
